This <me_Summon>Summon</> is <me_Intangible>Intangible</>.

This <me_Summon>Summon</> expends itself to debuff an enemy for <b>{Duration}|fmt(time,max_frac=1)</>. This debuff applies <b>{dataBase.ExecutionThreshold}|fmt(sign,max_frac=0)</> <me_ExecutionThreshold>Execution Threshold</>. An enemy can only be debuffed by one Keres at once.

Buff yourself for <b>{Duration}|fmt(time,max_frac=1)</>.
{DescriptionComponent[CurrentHealthPercentCostPerSecond]}
While active gains <b>{IncreasedHealthCost}|fmt(perc1,max_frac=1)</> increased Health Cost every <b>{HealthCostRampPeriod}|fmt(time,max_frac=1)</> up to <b>{IncreasedHealthCostLimit}|fmt(perc1,max_frac=1)</>.
Cooldown does not recover while active.
Re-use to deactivate early.

While active grants:
 {DescriptionComponent[IncreasedTotalDamage]}
